    "name": "Express REST API - User Management",
    "description": "Postman Collection để kiểm thử toàn bộ API quản lý User.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:3000\n\nCác test cases bao gồm:\n- TC01-TC02: GET /api/users\n- TC03-TC09: POST /api/users\n- TC10-TC12: GET /api/users/:id\n- TC13-TC16: PUT /api/users/:id\n- TC17-TC19: DELETE /api/users/:id\n- TC20: GET / (Health Check)",
